Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: mdl_scoring (validates ADR 0019)
Purpose:
    Contrast sample-frequency ranking with MDL-gain ranking; confirm
    that `min_mdl_gain > 0` in the naming policy suppresses singleton
    candidates during `autonomous_pass` while keeping legitimately
    reusable patterns.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0019 (NamingPolicy::min_mdl_gain, SkipReason::BelowMdlGain,
    RSet::mdl_gain, RSet::score_by_mdl, consider_naming updated).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0019.
    Runner: v2/examples/mdl_scoring.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example mdl_scoring

